# oracle: fix sgcmc with a pair style other than EAM (lj/cut, two types of mass 1 and 2): the generic method (total energy after and before each trial, then setup_minimal(0)), 864 fcc atoms in lj units, NVE, an MC event every 5 steps, 15 steps.
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units lj
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 0.8442
region box block 0 6 0 6 0 6
create_box 2 box
create_atoms 1 box
set type 1 type/fraction 2 0.3 777
mass 1 1.0
mass 2 2.0
pair_style lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff 1 1 1.0 1.0
pair_coeff 2 2 1.2 1.05
pair_coeff 1 2 0.9 1.0
velocity all create 1.0 87287 loop geom
fix integrate all nve
fix mc all sgcmc 5 0.1 1.0 0.3 randseed 2468
thermo_style custom step temp pe press f_mc[1] f_mc[2] f_mc[3] f_mc[4]
thermo_modify format float %.15g
thermo 5
run 15
